WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:02.380
- If you follow me on Instagram,

00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:04.670
welcome to the party and thank you.

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:07.738
You know that I love to
share tips and tricks

00:00:07.738 --> 00:00:10.442
to all things from design to beauty.

00:00:10.442 --> 00:00:13.221
And I actually posted a video using Crest,

00:00:13.221 --> 00:00:15.630
which I just posted 'cause I love it,

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:17.200
and I've been using it my whole life

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:20.010
and it whitens my teeth and I'm a diehard.

00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:22.328
So Crest saw the video
and reached out to see

00:00:22.328 --> 00:00:23.830
if we could team up.

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:27.840
And I thought, ah yes, please count me in.

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:29.790
So we're gonna celebrate what they say

00:00:29.790 --> 00:00:32.520
is their strongest
whitening toothpaste yet.

00:00:32.520 --> 00:00:35.431
Ah Crest 3D White Brilliance.

00:00:35.431 --> 00:00:36.820
(clapping)

00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:38.560
I'm so excited.

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:40.290
Well they're making people smile,

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:43.250
so let me introduce you to
someone who's really going

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:46.850
to put a smile on your
face like she did to mine.

00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:49.926
She's a brilliant young
woman doing brilliant things.

00:00:49.926 --> 00:00:51.665
At just 17 years old,

00:00:51.665 --> 00:00:55.125
she's the innovator behind Talking Masks,

00:00:55.125 --> 00:00:58.140
which are specifically designed for those

00:00:58.140 --> 00:00:59.930
who need to read lips.

00:00:59.930 --> 00:01:03.641
Please welcome 17 year
old Isabella Appell.

00:01:03.641 --> 00:01:05.130
(audience cheering)

00:01:05.130 --> 00:01:06.380
Hi Isabella.
- Hi Drew.

00:01:06.380 --> 00:01:07.213
- Hello.

00:01:08.710 --> 00:01:10.651
- I'm so excited to be here today.

00:01:10.651 --> 00:01:13.454
- I am so glad that we've
been brought together.

00:01:13.454 --> 00:01:18.454
I love your story so much and
I'm gonna start by saying,

00:01:19.130 --> 00:01:23.245
obviously masks are a reality
of the world right now,

00:01:23.245 --> 00:01:27.410
and you wanted to take
a different approach.

00:01:27.410 --> 00:01:30.133
Will you please tell
me about what you did?

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:33.850
- Yes so I created Talking Masks

00:01:33.850 --> 00:01:35.540
at the beginning of quarantine,

00:01:35.540 --> 00:01:37.317
which my goal with that
was to raise awareness

00:01:37.317 --> 00:01:41.090
for the deaf and hard of hearing
community during this time.

00:01:41.090 --> 00:01:45.100
And with this Talking
Mask, as you can see,

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:46.380
it has a clear window on it,

00:01:46.380 --> 00:01:49.070
which allows for those
who rely on lip reading

00:01:49.070 --> 00:01:50.333
to communicate, do so.

00:01:50.333 --> 00:01:54.234
- And you don't profit off of this do you?

00:01:54.234 --> 00:01:56.600
- No I make no profit at all.

00:01:56.600 --> 00:01:59.488
Every donation goes directly
to the Hearing Aid Project,

00:01:59.488 --> 00:02:01.270
which provides hearing aids to those

00:02:01.270 --> 00:02:02.816
who cannot afford them themselves.

00:02:02.816 --> 00:02:03.649
- Well.

00:02:03.649 --> 00:02:05.340
(audience clapping)

00:02:05.340 --> 00:02:08.380
I know we all love you here so much.

00:02:08.380 --> 00:02:12.060
I also heard on top of being a pioneer

00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:15.610
and a businesswoman and
an all around do-gooder,

00:02:15.610 --> 00:02:19.071
you just became president of your school.

00:02:19.071 --> 00:02:21.740
- Yes I did, last week.

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:25.213
- Okay what's your
first order of business?

00:02:27.070 --> 00:02:29.590
- Okay well obviously during this time,

00:02:29.590 --> 00:02:32.200
bringing together my school as a community

00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:34.080
is so important to me.

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:39.000
So my goal with that is to
invite one board representative

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:42.330
from every club on campus
to student council,

00:02:42.330 --> 00:02:44.550
and that way we can help them with events,

00:02:44.550 --> 00:02:45.667
maybe hang posters for them,

00:02:45.667 --> 00:02:48.890
or just get more people involved
in their club in general.

00:02:48.890 --> 00:02:50.100
- Do you like to have a nice,

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:53.610
like well rounded out group
that represents different needs,

00:02:53.610 --> 00:02:57.380
viewpoints, interests so
that you can really diversify

00:02:57.380 --> 00:02:59.320
for your school?

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:02.370
- Yeah that's one of the main goals of my,

00:03:02.370 --> 00:03:04.300
of me being in student
council this year actually.

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:05.895
- That's what I was getting the sense of.

00:03:05.895 --> 00:03:06.780
I just,

00:03:06.780 --> 00:03:08.630
I admire that so much.

00:03:08.630 --> 00:03:11.253
I just think when we can come together,

00:03:12.618 --> 00:03:14.870
I'm so in favor of that,

00:03:14.870 --> 00:03:17.740
and we're so impressed with you here.

00:03:17.740 --> 00:03:21.210
We're in awe of all the
things you're accomplishing

00:03:21.210 --> 00:03:24.449
and we're gonna be donating $5,000

00:03:24.449 --> 00:03:27.140
to the Hearing Aid Project of yours.

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:30.190
And Target is going to give you

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:32.999
a $1,000 gift card for supplies.

00:03:32.999 --> 00:03:34.250
(audience cheering)

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:36.270
- Thank you so much.

00:03:36.270 --> 00:03:37.920
- Actually thank you Isabella,

00:03:37.920 --> 00:03:39.390
and we can't wait to watch you

00:03:39.390 --> 00:03:42.408
take over the world one
bright smile at a time.

00:03:42.408 --> 00:03:43.540
(audience clapping)

00:03:43.540 --> 00:03:44.373
- Thank you.

00:03:44.373 --> 00:03:45.340
- Thank you, Isabella.

00:03:46.226 --> 00:03:48.210
And when Crest teamed up with us,

00:03:48.210 --> 00:03:51.470
they actually told our whole
team that they truly believe

00:03:51.470 --> 00:03:53.010
in their product because they want people

00:03:53.010 --> 00:03:56.750
to have confidence to
unleash their own smile.

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:58.990
That's actually seriously a term that they

00:03:58.990 --> 00:04:00.510
and their team uses.

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:01.430
Ready?

00:04:01.430 --> 00:04:03.850
Unleash your smile.

00:04:03.850 --> 00:04:06.270
And if Crest 3D White
Brilliance can encourage you

00:04:06.270 --> 00:04:08.445
to have a little more
confidence on your next Zoom,

00:04:08.445 --> 00:04:10.440
well that's what they did for me.

00:04:10.440 --> 00:04:13.560
So I think we can all smile together now.

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:14.586
Thanks to Crest.

00:04:14.586 --> 00:04:17.169
(upbeat music)

